> show 0.1234567890123456789012345
_() = 0.123456789
  -> real
> show 3.1415926535897932384626433832795028841971
_() = pi
  -> real
> show 9007199254740993
_() = 9007199254740993
  -> int
> expand 0.1234567890123456789^2
  ucas: expand 0.1234567890123456789^2
expand 0.01524157875
  = 0.01524157875
  note: coefficients are printed rounded (numbers in expressions are doubles), so no exact check is printed
> expand 2^60*x
  ucas: expand 2^60*x
expand 1.152921505e+18x
  = 1.152921505e+18x
  note: coefficients are printed rounded (numbers in expressions are doubles), so no exact check is printed
> expand 1/999999937*x
  ucas: expand 1/999999937*x
expand 1.000000063e-09x
  = 1.000000063e-09x
  note: coefficients are printed rounded (numbers in expressions are doubles), so no exact check is printed
> show 0.1+0.2
_() = 0.3
  -> real
> expand 0.1 + 0.2
  ucas: expand 0.1 + 0.2
expand 0.3
  = 0.3
  note: coefficients are printed rounded (numbers in expressions are doubles), so no exact check is printed
